  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Prophecy Against Egypt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Judgment on Pharaoh",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the tenth year, in the tenth month on the twelfth day, the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.29.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.29.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to me:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Son of man, set your face against Pharaoh king of Egypt and prophesy against him and against all Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Speak to him and say: 'This is what the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.29.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 29:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\" 'I am against you, Pharaoh king of Egypt,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 29:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you great monster lying among your streams.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 29:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "You say, \"The Nile belongs to me;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 29:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I made it for myself.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I will put hooks in your jaws",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 29:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and make the fish of your streams stick to your scales.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 29:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I will pull you out from among your streams,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 29:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "with all the fish sticking to your scales.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will leave you in the desert,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 29:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you and all the fish of your streams.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 29:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "You will fall on the open field",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 29:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and not be gathered or picked up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "EZK 29:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I will give you as food",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 29:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "to the beasts of the earth and the birds of the sky.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then all who live in Egypt will know that I am the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.29.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "EZK 29:6"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "EZK 29:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\" 'You have been a staff of reed for the people of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they grasped you with their hands, you splintered and you tore open their shoulders; when they leaned on you, you broke and their backs were wrenched.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Therefore this is what the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.29.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.29.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: I will bring a sword against you and kill both man and beast.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egypt will become a desolate wasteland. Then they will know that I am the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.29.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "EZK 29:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\" 'Because you said, \"The Nile is mine; I made it,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "therefore I am against you and against your streams, and I will make the land of Egypt a ruin and a desolate waste from Migdol to Aswan, as far as the border of Cush.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The foot of neither man nor beast will pass through it; no one will live there for forty years.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make the land of Egypt desolate among devastated lands, and her cities will lie desolate forty years among ruined cities. And I will disperse the Egyptians among the nations and scatter them through the countries.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Yet this is what the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.29.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.29.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: At the end of forty years I will gather the Egyptians from the nations where they were scattered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will bring them back from captivity and return them to Upper Egypt, the land of their ancestry. There they will be a lowly kingdom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It will be the lowliest of kingdoms and will never again exalt itself above the other nations. I will make it so weak that it will never again rule over the nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egypt will no longer be a source of confidence for the people of Israel but will be a reminder of their sin in turning to her for help. Then they will know that I am the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.29.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nebuchadnezzar's Reward",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the twenty-seventh year, in the first month on the first day, the word of the",
